    {
      "width": "380px",
      "right": "275px",
      "text": "שהן ד' (<sup class=\"footnote-marker\">*</sup><i class=\"footnote\">ד\"ת</i> <i class=\"footnote\">מ\"ז</i><i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Offerings for Unintentional Transgressions\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>את שיש בה ידיעה בתחלה",
